    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFormer public house with significant redevelopment potential, prominently positioned on a corner site in the heart of Swinford.\n\nThis property formerly operated as a licensed premises with residential lodgings overhead. The property extends over three floors and offers excellent scope for refurbishment, redevelopment or mixed-use investment, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a spacious bar area to the front with additional seating accommodation to the rear, together with customer bathroom facilities. Also located at ground floor level are a kitchen, living room and bedroom.\n\nThe upper floors contain a number of bedrooms which were previously used as rental accommodation/lodgings, offering obvious potential for residential conversion or refurbishment.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from sheds and additional storage structures to the rear.\n\nWhile vacant for a number of years and requiring investment, the property offers enormous potential for a variety of uses including hospitality, residential conversion, mixed-use development or investor refurbishment project.\n\nIts prominent Main Street location ensures excellent visibility and accessibility within the town centre, with all local amenities and services nearby.\n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account."
      },
